# =========================
# Hugo Professional .gitignore
# =========================

# --- Private / agent instructions (keep local, not committed) ---
.sisyphus/
AGENTS.local.md
/fab_predictive_maintenance_ppt169/
/edge_ai_platform_ppt169/

# --- Scratch drafts (原始草稿，非發布內容) ---
# 這些檔案若放進 content/*/posts/*/ 會被 Hugo 當成頁面渲染，
# 甚至因 shortcode 缺 template 直接讓 hugo build 失敗。統一放 drafts/。
/drafts/
**/ChatGPT_artical.md
**/edge-ai-platform-blog-en.md

/content/zh-tw/posts/hello-world.md

# --- Anti-theft watermarked source images ---
# 已燒進投影片 PNG 的來源圖，不進版控。** 開頭的 ** 不可省略：
# 少了它只擋根目錄，擋不住 content/zh-tw/posts/*/images/ 底下的同名檔。
**/*_protected.png

# --- Generated site output ---
/public/
/resources/_gen/
/assets/jsconfig.json
hugo_stats.json

# --- Hugo cache ---
.hugo_build.lock
/resources/_cache/

# --- Node / Frontend tooling ---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

# --- Build tools ---
dist/
build/
.cache/
.tmp/
temp/

# --- OS generated files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- IDE / Editor ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.iml

# --- Logs ---
*.log
logs/

# --- Environment variables ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Deployment ---
.vercel/
.netlify/
.firebase/

# --- Docker ---
docker-compose.override.yml

# --- Optional: Ignore local config ---
config/_default/params.local.toml
config/development/

# --- Optional: Ignore draft content exports ---
exports/
backups/

# --- Python (if using scripts/tools) ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# --- Go (Hugo modules) ---
bin/
pkg/

# --- Mac/Linux temp files ---
*~
*.tmp

# =========================
# Keep Hugo module files
# =========================
!go.mod
!go.sum

# =========================
# Keep important assets
# =========================
!/static/
!/content/
!/layouts/
!/themes/
!/archetypes/
!/data/
!/i18n/
